<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand Treasury's latest fiscal outlook table.</title>
<headline>New Zealand Treasury's latest fiscal outlook table.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the budget fiscal outlook table released by the New Zealand Treasury on Thursday. The forecasts are for June years.</p>
<p>Brackets contain previous forecasts from the Budget Policy Statement released in March.</p>
<p>In billions of NZ dollars:</p>
<p>		    1997/98	1998/99	1999/00</p>
<p>    Net worth   7.6 (9.3)     9.5 (11.9)  12.1 (15.4)</p>
<p>    Pct/GDP     7.6 (9.2)     9.0 (11.3)  10.9 (13.8)</p>
<p>    Net debt    25.2 (23.6)  24.3 (22.1)  22.7 (19.8)</p>
<p>    Pct/GDP     25.5 (23.4)  23.2 (21.0)  20.5 (17.8)</p>
<p>    Revenue     35.7 (36.4)  36.7 (36.7)  38.6 (38.4)</p>
<p>    Pct/GDP     36.1 (36.1)  35.0 (34.8)  34.8 (34.5)</p>
<p>    Expenses    34.6 (33.7)  35.4 (34.8)  36.7 (33.1)</p>
<p>    Pct/GDP     35.0 (32.5)  33.8 (31.3)  33.2 (29.7)</p>
<p>    Surplus	1.5  (3.3)   1.9  (2.6)   2.6  (3.5)</p>
<p>    Pct/GDP	1.5  (3.2)   1.8  (2.5)   2.3  (3.1)</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
